00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,492
Here is the whole map so far, plus the one we meet next.

2
00:00:04,492 --> 00:00:07,994
Order matters with no repeats: n P r.

3
00:00:07,994 --> 00:00:14,023
With repeats: n to the r. Identical objects: divide by their factorials.

4
00:00:14,023 --> 00:00:18,802
A circle: n minus one factorial, halved for a garland.

5
00:00:18,802 --> 00:00:22,565
And when order does not matter at all: n C r.

